    "input": "search_document: Hello! Thank you for choosing Northwind Outdoor. I am happy to clarify the loyalty program rules for you so you can make your purchase with confidence.\n\nBased on our handbook, here are the confirmed details regarding your questions:\n\n**1. Membership Cost**\nYes, joining the Northwind Outdoor Loyalty Program is **completely free**. There is **no annual fee**, no hidden subscription cost, and no minimum purchase requirement to join. Your membership remains active indefinitely as long as you make at least one qualifying purchase within the last 365 days [loyalty_program_1].\n\n**2. Earning Points**\nYes, it is true that you earn **1 loyalty point for every $1.00 spent** on eligible items. This includes all bikes, camping gear, accessories, and apparel sold directly by Northwind Outdoor [loyalty_program_2].\n\n**Important Notes for Your Purchase:**\n*   **Eligibility:** Points are earned on eligible items. However, points are **not** earned on gift cards, store credit, or items purchased during clearance sales marked with a \"No Points\" tag [loyalty_program_2].\n*   **Timing:** Points are credited to your account within 24 hours of the order being shipped [loyalty_program_2].\n*   **Expiration:** Loyalty points are valid for **12 months** from the date they are earned. For example, if you earn points today, they will expire one year from today [loyalty_program_3].\n\n**Regarding Your Tent and Sleeping Gear:**\nSince you mentioned buying a tent and sleeping gear, please note that if you purchase a complete camping kit (which includes a tent, sleeping bag, and camp stove) simultaneously, you may be eligible for a **15% bundle discount** [discounts_3]. However, please be aware that this bundle discount **does not apply to clearance items** [discounts_3]. If your items are part of a clearance sale, they may be marked with a \"No Points\" tag, meaning you would not earn loyalty points on those specific items [loyalty_program_2].\n\nTo summarize:\n*   **Fee:** $0 [loyalty_program_1]\n*   **Points Rate:** 1 point per $1.00 [loyalty_program_2]\n*   **Point Validity:** 12 months [loyalty_program_3]\n\nI hope this helps clarify the rules for you. If you have any further questions, please let me know!",
